    fix(identity): zero-config tags and pre.json for same-named packages (#168)

    Default tags follow the display id, so promoted packages never share tags and E101 needs no tag-template. A promoted package still finds its bare `foo@*` history through tags whose commit contains only its manifest, and a bare pre.json key moves to the package that existed when pre.json was added (E245 when that is undecidable). E103 now shows the qualified form to write.

